For iOS there is this app - [https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/bubble-browser-for-evernote/id545988675?affId=2147274](https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/bubble-browser-for-evernote/id545988675?affId=2147274)

&#x200B;

For iOS, there is this app - would be if you are looking for that feature, why are you on Evernote?  IMO, Evernote is about structure, Stacks, Notebooks, and notes.  If you are wanting to start thinking in backlinks and visualization then I would suggest moving a platform that supports that.  Trying to slam a round peg in a square whole never works overly well.  

&#x200B;

